<section class="cfc-about cfc-brand-page cfc-about--identity" aria-label="About CuteFurCompanions">
  <div class="cfc-container cfc-about__inner">
    <div class="cfc-about__art">
      {% if image != blank %}
        {{ image | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: widths: '450,900,1200', sizes: '(min-width: 750px) 42vw, 85vw', loading: 'eager', alt: shop.name }}
      {% else %}
        {% render 'brand', full: true %}
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="cfc-about__copy">
      <h1>About Us</h1>
      <div class="cfc-richtext">
        <p>At CuteFurCompanions, we turn the world’s wildest places into something you can wear. Each collection explores a different realm, from the Arctic and Antarctic to deserts, rainforests and beyond, through its wildlife, flora and landscapes.</p>
        <p>Our hope is simple: when you wear a piece from one of these realms, you carry a little part of that place with you, spark curiosity, and perhaps help someone discover something about the world they have never seen before.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="cfc-brand-motto">We give you the biome to wear.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>